  "bodyHash": "9bb24d368f864f45",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Edo5jnW.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client & Server-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Spiky Spikes</strong> 添加了一些非常尖锐的尖刺。共有多个等级，每种都拥有独特的能力。你还在等什么？快来升级你的生物农场吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Spiky Spikes 为你带来 <strong>6 种等级</strong>的尖刺，每种都独一无二。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>木质：</strong> 缓慢对生物造成伤害，但不会直接击杀。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>石质：</strong> 对生物造成伤害并击杀，但不会掉落任何战利品或经验值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>铁质：</strong> 对生物造成伤害并击杀，仅掉落普通战利品，不掉落经验值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>金质：</strong> 对生物造成伤害并击杀，仅掉落经验值，不掉落任何战利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>钻石：</strong> 造成大量伤害，生物死亡后掉落所有战利品，如同被玩家击杀一样。可使用大多数剑类附魔，通过铁砧进行附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>下界合金：</strong> 造成大量伤害，生物死亡后掉落所有战利品，如同被玩家击杀一样。可使用大多数剑类附魔，通过铁砧进行附魔。具有抗爆炸性，且无法被凋灵Boss摧毁。对玩家不造成伤害。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong> 为钻石和下界合金尖刺附魔时，请确保将所有需要附魔的尖刺一次性准备好。你可以将附魔书<strong>应用到整个堆叠</strong>，因此稍后再附魔更多尖刺会无谓地消耗你珍贵的附魔书。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 截图：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/957/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/958/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>尖刺确实很尖锐</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>木质尖刺可将生物血量降至半颗心</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/959/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/960/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>即便是凋灵Boss也无法抵挡下界合金尖刺的伤害</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>可应用于尖刺的所有附魔</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Forge 上配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 安装我的<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a>模组，即可在游戏内直接进行配置！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Fabric 上配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 目前尚未实现在游戏内直接编辑配置文件的功能。相反，在世界中运行<code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code>命令，选择<code>CLIENT</code>或<code>SERVER</code>（取决于模组），然后单击聊天栏中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），即可在外部编辑器中手动编辑配置文件。保存文件后，配置文件将在几秒后在游戏内自动重新加载，无需重启游戏。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Spiky Spikes 的开发得到了以下帮助与启发：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a> 从他们旧版<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Extra Utilities</span></a>模组中的尖刺方块获取灵感，启发了本模组</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>XFactHD</strong></span></a> 将我引入了在 Minecraft 中渲染非立方体形状的“黑暗艺术”</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ALHMDQn.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
